# Project rules

Read `AGENTS.md` for FSM, packages, invariants.

- Prefer small same-package files in `internal/update` (no god files).
- Do not change query fail-open (unreachable = empty) or state-based per-child sync without explicit ask.
- Never decide child sync from child volume LocalBuildID (bind mounts mirror main).
- Only `prod` mutates; dry-run/check-only must stay non-mutating.
- Keep modules tiny; Linux-only binary on Wings as root.
